## Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant C as Clerk
    participant API as API Routes
    participant GS as Google Sheets API
    participant S as User's Spreadsheet

    U->>F: Visit app
    F->>C: Check auth
    C-->>F: Authenticated / Redirect to sign-in
    
    Note over F: First time user
    F->>API: GET /api/user/config
    API-->>F: No spreadsheet configured
    F->>U: Show Onboarding Wizard
    U->>F: Enter spreadsheet URL
    F->>API: POST /api/sheets/validate
    API->>GS: Check access to spreadsheet
    GS->>S: Try to read
    S-->>GS: Access denied
    GS-->>API: Error: No access
    API-->>F: Need permission
    F->>U: "Grant editor access to sheets-formatter@..."
    U->>S: Shares with service account
    U->>F: Retry validation
    F->>API: POST /api/sheets/validate
    API->>GS: Check + Create sheets
    GS->>S: Create Borrows, EMIs, Payments, Details
    S-->>GS: Success
    API-->>F: Setup complete!
    
    Note over F: Normal usage
    U->>F: Add new borrow
    F->>API: POST /api/sheets/borrows
    API->>GS: Append row to Borrows sheet
    GS->>S: Write data
    S-->>GS: OK
    API-->>F: Borrow added
    F->>U: Show updated UI
```

